{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "13a26c1cb1df67392f0eb41d1600ab00e840a040906999cbd3025ca497b9b071", "ja": "（今日はこのみさんの、京都観光案内ロケだった。\nこのみさんの着物姿、よく似合ってたな）", "zh": "（今天是木实小姐的京都观光向导外景拍摄。木实小姐穿和服的样子，很适合她呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "d0407f7d4512639712f239e88302d84e27f9303c9e656df2bfb562a9a278904f", "ja": "お待たせ、着替え終わったわよ。もうっ、\nそれより{$P$}、聞いてくれる？", "zh": "让你久等了，我已经换好衣服了。真是的，先不说这个，{$P$}，你听我说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "93ae254c7e46ac07238fdecdca63228be47783bd8e281fdf02c731b896c2c708", "ja": "お疲れさまでした、このみさん。\n何かあったんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，木下小姐。\n发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "33bd0d145ad0a75f9ae8d1601afdd86da92a77c3ba1967fdadc29377347f8b19", "ja": "さっきの撮影で、京都の町を歩いてる時、\nすれ違った人に言われたのよ。", "zh": "刚才拍摄时，在京都街头走路的时候，\n有个和我擦肩而过的人对我说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "0db4c57ef26c9bd604cfa3a9f8ae3e84d6263ca99fce08677655935cb7994a95", "ja": "「小さいのに着物をちゃんと着られて、\nえらいわねぇ」……って！", "zh": "“年纪这么小就能把和服穿得这么整齐，\n真了不起呀”……对方这么说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "be8413bc668e1e294bd21220f9828f3e700ea6762ea4bce4572cff69ba8e4190", "ja": "お仕事中は笑顔を……と思って、黙ってたけど！\nもう着替えたし、言っても良いわよね！？", "zh": "工作时要保持微笑……我是这么想的，所以一直忍着没说！\n不过现在已经换好衣服了，说出来应该没关系了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5f907a37694a79e3e9212b0b29dd74b07b65c6e4c72694d31a6e52649efdb078", "ja": "ああ……それは、はい。このみさんが\n怒るのも、仕方がありませんね。", "zh": "啊……那件事，嗯。木实小姐会生气，也是情有可原。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "062a0337dac531c3b5f18d7da3f7880d0eef3d58dbf74e96a4a088ba4a9d30ac", "ja": "こんなにアダルティな女性を相手に、\n失礼しちゃうわ。まったく！", "zh": "面对这么成熟的女性，居然这样失礼，真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a3df62e6b380d0e43c32a024ffbd4e9c8e28bedce130f5a430f282bb559b0938", "ja": "まあまあ、このみさん。\n気持ちもわかりますが、もう夜も遅いですから。", "zh": "好了好了，木实小姐。\n我能理解你的心情，不过时间已经很晚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1009_p", "source_sha256": "755195aeaf51affdaed70344650a8e96d2c622dd78df1814d793af0e0a7fd653", "ja": "続きは、宿泊先で聞きますよ。\nもうすぐ近くですから。", "zh": "剩下的部分，到了住宿的地方我再听你说。已经快到附近了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "1a8ecd386e7ccc6df9a0793177673fda1ab906f685cfac05c03e3567f0d91050", "ja": "はぁ、それもそうね。それじゃ、今夜は\nお姉さんの晩酌に、付き合ってもらおうかしら？", "zh": "哈啊，说得也是。那今晚要不要陪姐姐小酌几杯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "21caa6dd6f2b6d2cfe6b4945f566ad1b90a02f4214fef9ffafe9803b7285d190", "ja": "京都って、美味しい地酒がいっぱいあるんでしょう？\n今回のお仕事は、それも楽しみだったのよね♪", "zh": "京都有很多美味的当地酒，对吧？\n这次的工作，我也很期待这一点呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cb75d65fd6637c260cc27b6843e59d176ff43eddd2634ce61f0b0cd041fcd6d0", "ja": "そう言うと思って、\nちゃんと用意しておきました。", "zh": "我就知道你会这么说，已经提前准备好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "59ca4402035cd8db4456cf126d6954baa4663bfbdbe0b617c443f46b2b144ba7", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}！\nふふっ、なんだか気を使わせちゃったみたいね。", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n呵呵，总觉得让你费心了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "cf84775f30642e1af87c3d3f8a5e67a99ae655aedf25ed09500b4a3c30e3fe18", "ja": "{$P$}に付き合ってもらう分、\n明日からのお仕事もがんばらなくちゃ。", "zh": "既然你陪了我{$P$}，\n明天的起的工作我也得好好加油才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2e8f58bb02fb6f80ddd58951575b971c928c6d6523b5b8b3885a9e96b9ddce82", "ja": "そうしてもらえると助かります。ひとまず、\n今夜はゆっくりして、疲れを癒してください。", "zh": "能这样就帮大忙了。总之，今晚请好好休息，消除疲劳吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "88ff8b5e349818b534268e04a92f666f9cb1b4539f242594e2d69d0cbfda9add", "ja": "ありがとう！　それじゃ、お言葉に甘えて……\nまずは、何の話からしようかしら？", "zh": "谢谢！那我就恭敬不如从命了……\n首先，我们该从什么话题聊起呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "18fde49be1feefdb74bc28ae5e2fbbe883d288f84746c115f693dab660b03be3", "ja": "最初はやっぱり、私の着物姿についての感想よね。\n美味しいお酒の肴に、たっぷり語ってもらうわよ♪", "zh": "首先当然是要聊聊我穿和服的感想啦。\n就着美酒，好好跟我说个够吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_039kon0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_039kon0133_1018_p", "source_sha256": "10625b6dbc1cdaf408a419eb0487adf0c99007e56fc41f492281c094bed302e8", "ja": "（少し嫌な事があっても、しっかり気持ちを\n切り替えられる。やっぱり、このみさんは大人だな！）", "zh": "（就算遇到些不开心的事，也能好好调整心情。果然，这就是成年人的成熟啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
